{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-11-30 12:58:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY BUILDING NEW TRANSMISSION LINE IN NORTHEAST OHIO', 'text': 'PROJECT TO BENEFIT 28,000 CUSTOMERS AND ACCOMMODATE FUTURE GROWTH AKRON, OHIO , NOV. 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICAN TRANSMISSION SYSTEMS, INC. (ATSI), A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), IS CONSTRUCTING A NEW HIGH-VOLTAGE TRANSMISSION LINE IN LORAIN COUNTY, OHIO, THAT WILL ENHANCE SERVICE RELIABILITY FOR APPROXIMATELY 28,000 CUSTOMERS AND ACCOMMODATE INCREASING DEMAND FOR ELECTRICITY IN THE FUTURE. THE 138-KILOVOLT TRANSMISSION LINE, BUILT ALONGSIDE EXISTING POWER LINES, EXTENDS FROM A SUBSTATION IN THE CITY OF LORAIN TO A SUBSTATION IN WELLINGTON TOWNSHIP AND WILL IMPROVE SERVICE FOR CUSTOMERS IN THE WELLINGTON, CARLISLE, HOMER AND SEVILLE AREAS.'}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-11-30 08:35:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY UTILITIES INVITE CUSTOMERS TO ENTER HOLIDAY LIGHTS CONTEST', 'text': 'COMPANY SHARES TIPS FOR SAFE HOLIDAY DECORATING AKRON, OHIO , NOV. 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS HOUSEHOLDS TAP INTO THE MAGIC OF THE HOLIDAY SEASON, FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE:FE) INVITES CUSTOMERS TO SHOW OFF THEIR BEST AND BRIGHTEST OUTDOOR HOLIDAY LIGHTING DISPLAYS FOR THE CHANCE TO WIN A WEEKLY PRIZE AS PART OF THE COMPANY\'S ANNUAL "MERRY & BRIGHT" HOLIDAY LIGHTS SWEEPSTAKES. CUSTOMERS CAN SUBMIT A PHOTO OR VIDEO OF THEIR OUTDOOR LIGHTING DISPLAYS ON THEIR RESPECTIVE ELECTRIC COMPANY\'S FACEBOOK® PAGE UNTIL FRIDAY, DEC. 16.'}